# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output and dependencies
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.svelte-kit/
build/
dist/
.vercel/
target/
*.log

# Local database and scratch state
.data/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal

# Environment. `.env.example` IS committed; nothing else is.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reference captures — NEVER committed to this repository.
#
# This repo exists because the previous one accumulated 215 MB of captures, 19 tracked files of
# which carried the owner's real email addresses, in history where a tree deletion could not
# reach them. Starting clean only stays clean if the rules that let it happen are carried
# forward, so they are here from the first commit rather than added after the first mistake.
#
# Every one of these is a dump of a LIVE room: real names, real addresses, gravatar MD5s, and in
# some cases a live JWT. They are read from `~/Desktop/new-room/`, never copied here. Findings
# belong in docs/ with a citation to the file and line; the capture itself stays out.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ptr-*.json
ptr[0-9]*.json
collect-*.json
proroom-*.json
must-match/
account-page/
mising/
second-dump/
more-fucking-evidence/
new-evidence/
gap-dump/
NEXT-STEP/*.json
enterprise/
docs/generated/

# NOT ignored: `docs/source/` — the original app's own JS bundles, SHA-256 pinned. It was excluded
# once on a false positive: a PII sweep flagged it, but the only address in all 203 files is
# `johndoe@gmail.com`, the vendor's own placeholder. Excluding it broke 24 test files, because 42
# of them read those bundles as the byte-for-byte authority they are pinned against.

# The two predecessor repositories. Never a subdirectory of this one.
new-room/
new-room-control/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS and editor
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Symlinks to the capture folders, which live in `new-room/` and are never copied here. The
# evidence-bound tests read them by relative path, so the links make those tests runnable locally
# without any of the captures entering this repository. Absent on CI, where those tests cannot run
# anyway — the same limit the absolute-path side-by-side tests already have.
/apps/room/alert-section
/apps/room/app-message-modal
/apps/room/app-modals
/apps/room/app-room
/apps/room/app-session
/apps/room/css
/apps/room/navbar-section
/apps/room/new-evidence
/apps/room/preview
/apps/room/second-dump
/apps/room/emojis
/apps/room/modal
/apps/room/toast-container
/apps/room/mention-reply-private-chat.clean.html
# `proroom-ULTIMATE-*.json` is already covered by the `proroom-*.json` rule above.
